@description Server-side: rolls and creates a reward/drop item instance to be dropped near a unit. Determines item level from the source unit (monster level, player level, or level-table mon level by difficulty/expansion; min 2) and writes it to *pnParam. If the unit carries a forced drop code, converts it to a class id; otherwise rolls an item class by level (for gold drops, retries up to 11 times until an Items.txt entry with the gold bitfield is found, then falls back to a normal class roll). Finds the best passable spawn spot in the unit's room, fills a D2ItemGenContextStrc (quality, position, level, class id) and calls ITEM_CreateItemInstance. If ppUnit is non-null, copies the 0x84-byte context out to it. Returns the created item unit (NULL on spawn-spot failure); halts with unrecoverable error on bad game ptr or bad item code.

